<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="TVM5.10.7">
<l>oṇcuṭarō ṭiruḷumāy niṉṟa vāṟu muṇmaiyō ṭiṉmaiyāy vanteṉ</l>
<l>kaṇko ḷāvakai nīkaran teṉṉaic ceykiṉṟaṉa</l>
<l>veṇkoḷ cintaiyu ṇaikiṉṟēṉeṉ kariya māṇikka mēyeṉ kaṇkaṭkut</l>
<l>tiṇkoḷḷa vorunā ḷaruḷāyuṉ ṟiruvuruvē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Taking counting</l>
<l>of the things you do to me, you hiding in a manner that my eye does not take [you] in,</l>
<l>coming as non-existence along with existence the way [you] stand as darkness along with bright light,</l>
	<l>I waste away in [that] thought. My black ruby, for my eyes</l>
<l>to firmly take [you] grace [me] one day with you sacred form.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
